sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Praxis Agent / Cell
    participant Client as PraxisReviewClient SDK
    participant SliceSvc as PraxisSliceAuditService
    participant PresAdapter as PraxisPresentationAdapter
    participant DiffStream as scanDiffStream
    participant MultiSvc as PraxisMultiAgentGovernanceService
    participant Ring as CircularDiffBuffer (R4)
    participant Rollback as PraxisRollbackEngine

    Agent->>Client: 1. Inner-loop edit -> reviewFile(filePath, content)
    Client->>SliceSvc: 2. Invoke auditSlice(input) via Sparse MoE
    SliceSvc-->>Client: Sub-10ms AST slice verdict + CAPP compact prompt
    Client->>PresAdapter: 3. Invoke fromSliceVerdict(verdict, target)
    Note over PresAdapter: 4. 并查集语义去重聚合<br/>(11 组 SEMANTIC_OVERLAP_GROUPS)<br/>同坐标高严重度选举主卡，次级入 correlatedRules
    PresAdapter-->>Client: 生成 PraxisPresentationPayload (富文本本地化卡片)
    Client-->>Agent: 5. 派发一体两面双载荷 (Agent: directivesMarkdown / Human: UI cards)
    
    Agent->>Client: 6. 提交分支补丁 -> evaluateMergeGate(src, target, hunks)
    Client->>DiffStream: 7. 推送增量事件流 scanDiffStream
    DiffStream->>Ring: 8. 环形缓冲缓存 Hunk (淘汰转储 Uint8Array R4)
    DiffStream->>Rollback: 9. 记录 TaskCard 锚点
    Client->>MultiSvc: 10. 多智能体合入仲裁 reviewMultiAgentPatches
    alt 依赖死锁或 GOV-AGN-001 冲突
        MultiSvc->>Rollback: 11a. 触发 revertCard(cardId) 原子 LIFO 逆序回滚
        Rollback-->>Client: 返回回滚修复结果
        Client-->>Agent: 阻断合入 (Blocked)
    else 门禁通过 Approved
        MultiSvc-->>Client: 11b. 批准合入
        Client-->>Agent: 派发 DualFacedDiffResult (Agent: 符号闭包 / Human: 视觉徽标与卡片)
    end
